press l
wait c complete
press G
wait /> [▸▾] ○ Point DNS at the new host/

press c
wait Cannot complete: item has unresolved blockers
frame refused-while-blocked

press [ [
wait /> [▸▾] ✓ Pick a theme/
press c
wait Marked incomplete
wait /> [▸▾] ○ Pick a theme/
frame toggled
press u
wait Undo:
wait /> [▸▾] ✓ Pick a theme/
frame undone

press x
gone Pick a theme
